        <activityName xml:lang="en">Tin plated chromium steel sheet, 2 mm, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Tin plated chromium steel sheet, 2 mm, at plant
The dataset can be applied for tin plated chromium steel sheets, preferably of steel 18/8 and sheet thickness of around 2 mm.;
UUID: ecb3845d-4193-3f4d-bd2b-e2c2187ea668
The dataset describes the production of tin plated chromium steel sheet. Included sub processes are "sheet rolling" and "tin plating". The basic material coated is chromium steel 18/8. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Tin plating of chromium steel sheet, including processes of tin plating and sheet rolling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, company information 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ecb3845d-4193-3f4d-bd2b-e2c2187ea668.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
